# SOPS-encrypted secrets must keep LF line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, and SOPS then
# fails to parse its own sops_lastmodified field:
#
#   parsing time "...Z\x0d": extra text: "\x0d"
#
# Without this line a fresh clone on Windows cannot decrypt its own secrets.
*.enc.env -text
